Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:23:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Retry transient hard-off BMC failures

Keep hard-off tasks pending across transient BMC connection and power operation failures. Observe power state before acting, persist the command observation window, and retry with capped backoff instead of marking the task failed.

Signed-off-by: howard-junec <junecao@amazon.com>
